                <l xml:id="m-f6efda06-5470-4227-b36d-3535087d4aac" facs="#m-feef6e54-39c8-4e6d-bb94-e4fc7af0e4e4" label="text-like">At Lauds</l><l xml:id="m-704603d6-207c-49db-802c-37f373d9bf39" facs="#m-c4221ec1-4502-4a3f-b62f-30ae5763bb7b" label="ambiguous">773</l><l xml:id="m-fab8e3ff-e0b1-4b52-9a92-e31a9297fe1b" facs="#m-e1072b2f-6a23-4cb8-bc12-7edddd3722f4" label="lyrics-like">in úmbra mór- tis. — Fá-ctus.</l><l xml:id="m-459d4216-6761-4a38-bb44-6d22f1720816" facs="#m-d458520e-3c62-486c-b5cb-2e1704c672cb" label="ambiguous">LESSON IX</l><l xml:id="m-e258c217-c528-4e4d-940c-7e30a49eff2c" facs="#m-54449d4b-e7b7-473f-8ab9-5ac13fe81a10" label="lyrics-like">Ecto enim omni mandáto legis ad vos Deus. Etiam tabernácu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a4a0f29-2180-4fdf-9cff-f6fcf7d7c5cf" facs="#m-124fe9c6-3f93-4807-9520-69d8bdd05db9" label="lyrics-like">I1 a Móyse univérso pópulo:</l><l xml:id="m-c63481ea-adca-428b-bb92-f05634a07f17" facs="#m-b1f9528f-33f8-4070-a81a-09f862124140" label="lyrics-like">lum, et ómnia vasa ministérii</l><l xml:id="m-b0bc2c67-960e-42b1-8678-e28640b4be85" facs="#m-1a0499cf-9783-4be7-9073-86e898ebdedd" label="lyrics-like">accipiens sánguinem vitulórum,</l><l xml:id="m-18d07f8a-52f0-4492-b075-b2fb0fd41c50" facs="#m-966f54b5-61aa-4c0e-87dd-0ab31abda88f" label="lyrics-like">sánguine similiter aspérsit: et</l><l xml:id="m-80de5e78-924e-4c04-b212-93df74b2c444" facs="#m-3e6bde55-cf11-419e-bd9d-f134d4e840bb" label="lyrics-like">et hircórum, cum aqua et lana</l><l xml:id="m-bc56bd32-5991-4691-ba56-18c8a958133c" facs="#m-8e9dd1fa-90ff-4150-a9c0-6cd283843574" label="lyrics-like">ómnia pene in sánguine secún¬</l><l xml:id="m-0af4ad48-a6e9-4ef5-929f-bd1177e589c5" facs="#m-c08882ab-7704-4fa3-9f18-096daea104a2" label="lyrics-like">coccinea, et hyssópo: ipsum</l><l xml:id="m-fd492224-fe78-4d96-8b41-38f45509f8ff" facs="#m-ed871465-7c39-4847-b034-58d643299bed" label="lyrics-like">dum legem mundántur: et sine</l><l xml:id="m-80ed57b4-82c0-4d45-a1c3-79a6bb6b9328" facs="#m-152aee77-cfc1-4494-8025-abe3a3c84103" label="lyrics-like">quoque librum, et omnem pópu¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb0b9120-87ec-4245-a639-f4119beaac81" facs="#m-f3a381eb-5b07-4d89-8630-9d24b1aa0e0c" label="lyrics-like">sánguinis effusióne non fit re¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee044697-7ed8-4031-a93b-db6d74a66075" facs="#m-667bb28e-22ed-4981-9d6c-0cbd05e8ff01" label="lyrics-like">lum aspérsit dicens: Hic san¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac604528-1ac9-46a7-b502-9a851d13b10f" facs="#m-07d2faf1-dc5a-4699-b386-185fcf225237" label="lyrics-like">míssio.</l><l xml:id="m-b00801ac-a5c9-461a-8807-8f7a45382fb0" facs="#m-c2d875ab-6c30-42bd-b6ff-0f72e292797b" label="lyrics-like">guis testaménti, quod mandávit</l><l xml:id="m-12f6b003-f8b3-4135-8bf2-9cf90b1e6059" facs="#m-3a1e4fd3-e697-4953-b432-3ab2d9fbd104" label="ambiguous">Resp.°</l><l xml:id="m-58573e5e-ba80-4dc5-a3ff-85395a78a13a" facs="#m-83ad3152-2154-42c5-b5e9-f0c6621a3292" label="lyrics-like">Epúlto" Dómino,</l><l xml:id="m-b0c708c3-a133-4365-b866-e6a88dbcefae" facs="#m-ed783379-5a5a-4170-9a69-e16d5bcc10af" label="lyrics-like">signátum est monumén¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3acedc6-cdf2-40f8-ae37-ece66473c5d0" facs="#m-9d5f76a6-4c0b-4ae9-a4ad-88652ca0a8ac" label="lyrics-like">tum, volvén-tes lápi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e21c406-7f8a-4f4d-9ce9-6306b210b345" facs="#m-9bb24a76-5e5e-4e8a-a4b9-8b6870e8e2e9" label="lyrics-like">dem ad ósti-um monumén¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d8ec594-fda7-4523-b292-9b6517756810" facs="#m-18f86c1e-892f-4665-9daf-0813acc9baa0" label="lyrics-like">ti : " Ponén-tes mí-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e064c59-7614-4ee5-beac-e5b4bb74ba7e" facs="#m-51810aa6-5a1d-4766-8032-371ce66cba42" label="lyrics-like">tes, qui custodí-rent fl¬</l><l xml:id="m-827ba3c6-b829-4c1d-8ac0-7848b7676f65" facs="#m-cffd20fe-bce6-4130-b04b-45cc0f861f33" label="lyrics-like">lum. V. Accedén-tes príncipes sacerdótum ad Pi-lá¬ tum,</l><l xml:id="m-57b57fd9-21bc-45d7-b012-70b2b566b69c" facs="#m-2b9f1f09-7de8-4667-9c12-62000fb28eaa" label="lyrics-like">érunt fl- lum. “Ponén-tes. K. Sepúl-to.</l><l xml:id="m-0aff198d-bffe-4907-a3a4-40ce7603d86a" facs="#m-cb31f345-6773-4fc5-91f5-f08e15e7d015" label="ambiguous">pe-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-5fbfcf7a-c115-4a3c-8b72-19caf83620a5" facs="#m-7670da71-1808-4be6-9c48-6cf486550130" label="text-like">AT LAUDS</l><l xml:id="m-9abc606c-835c-40ed-b332-d56268df1147" facs="#m-dc0064fd-5598-45f9-b18b-ee71d16f2d09" label="ambiguous">1 Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-5bfe2136-e017-4ade-910b-0adce41ba711" facs="#m-2c14e7cf-0a71-433f-907e-69812e603c24" label="ambiguous">1 e</l><l xml:id="m-16d31739-6457-4c7e-82c7-47b9d0b10dd4" facs="#m-c2108ed9-edea-415d-b7b1-4577729d09d1" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-1fb91e1b-78f4-48c0-9589-95dfb30a995a" facs="#m-7b929573-7b33-4586-af2c-90e158bac5b2" label="ambiguous">mors,"</l><l xml:id="m-4845e972-15f0-4996-922c-c70096fd4b81" facs="#m-eea08ffd-97ed-44d8-bcc8-01cd13c704e8" label="lyrics-like">éro mors tú-a: mórsus tú-us</l><l xml:id="m-c7546551-72e0-41b4-b12c-9c16aa367abf" facs="#m-6294cb45-d803-4ff0-afe6-95c21a4cb458" label="lyrics-like">éro,</l><l xml:id="m-0e73d61a-a14c-4cd9-9874-60d164eca955" facs="#m-1ab5cf2e-4b5b-44b9-b054-bfddcb9e752f" label="lyrics-like">inférne.</l></lg>
